; TEST-ONLY SMT-LIB2 parser. A SEPARATE library from the shipped printer (../dune) so it
; can NEVER be linked into the compiler artifact (DESIGN.md §3, AGENTS.md): shipped code
; depends on oxsmt_smtlib, never on oxsmt_smtlib_parser. The boundary is mechanical — the
; printer library does not list this library, and nothing under smt/ (besides the smtlib
; tests) may depend on it.
;
; Stdlib-only over oxsmt_core + oxsmt_smtlib (both stdlib-only), so it still honors the
; dependency firewall (I3) even though it is test-only.

(library
 (name oxsmt_smtlib_parser)
 (libraries oxsmt_core oxsmt_smtlib))
